# Laravel Boost (project skills)

- Add or edit skills under `.ai/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md` (not under `.cursor/skills/` for new work).
- Register the skill name in `boost.json` → `skills`.
- After changing skills or `boost.json`, run `vendor/bin/sail artisan boost:update`.
- Do not duplicate skill lists in `AGENTS.md`; Boost supplies skill discovery for agents that use it.
